{"4176320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Haamupeli: Wrath of the Iku-Turso", "steam_appid": 4176320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord server NOW UP! (see link at right side of the page) <br>NOTE: Steam Remote Play is supported for online multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark power stirs beneath the ground, threatening to engulf the world in chaos. In Haamupeli: Wrath of the Iku-Turso, a fantasy action-adventure game, you’ll embark on a quest to vanquish an ancient evil and forge your own legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mysterious lands, gather powerful loot, and recruit allies to stand by your side. Every choice shapes your journey — from the weapons you wield to the bonds you form and the battles you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haamupeli is an action-adventure  RPG inspired by legendary  titles such as Baldur’s Gate Dark Alliance, Diablo and Torchlight  mixed with oldschool classics like Rogue and Ultima series.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176320/extras/51f74f33acff0886473a9979769be62a.poster.avif?t=1785918561\" width=1170 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176320/extras/51f74f33acff0886473a9979769be62a.webm?t=1785918561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176320/extras/51f74f33acff0886473a9979769be62a.mp4?t=1785918561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living World</strong> - world log will keep player up to date of events that happen in the world even when player is not nearby</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty</strong> - besides few things world around you or quests do not get balanced around player level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayabilit</strong>y - play either in pre-genearted world or procedurally generated one with new characters, dungeons, and quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emerging quests</strong> - quests will be related to world events. Eg. if dangerous creatures move into a dungeon it is possible that nearby lord will give out task to eliminate the threat, etc</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless world</strong> - no loading screens during gameplay, everything happens at  seamless evolving area</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting</strong> - create spells, potions or enchant armor and weapons at crafting forges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vunderable NPCs</strong> - everyone in this game is vunderable. Even questgivers and plot critical creatures may be attacked and can get killed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Combat</strong> - even high level characters can get seriously injured by some lucky hits, no respawns at hardcore mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hall of Fame</strong> - most sucessful adventurers will be stored into a hall of fame on death or game completion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop Your Character - </strong>develop your character, discover hidden secrets, and interact with a living world full of lore and danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Co-Op Action -</strong> team up with a friend in 2-player split-screen co-op with full gamepad support (two controllers needed for local co-op play).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local PvP - </strong>player 2 plays as evil faction - last player to survive wins the match (<i>two controllers needed for local PvP play</i>).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Loot &amp; Progression</strong> - craft and <strong>h</strong>unt for rare items and relics and collect experience to enhance your abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emergent Gameplay:</strong> NPC characters may act and travel on their own can provide emergent gameplay possibilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176320/extras/e4f71ebdd64a55f5b70c5ed4e4345236.poster.avif?t=1785918561\" width=1170 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176320/extras/e4f71ebdd64a55f5b70c5ed4e4345236.webm?t=1785918561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4176320/extras/e4f71ebdd64a55f5b70c5ed4e4345236.mp4?t=1785918561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit allies, find  loot, develop your character and interact with the game world and its inhabitants to archieve your goals and attempt to vanquish a looming threat in a sandbox environment. Game features a fully unique world, characters and dungeons for each game session and 2 player local co-op gameplay with split screen, gamepads and <i>Steam Remote Play Together</i> supported.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord server NOW UP! (see link at right side of the page) <br>NOTE: Steam Remote Play is supported for online multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark power stirs beneath the ground, threatening to engulf the world in chaos. In Haamupeli: Wrath of the Iku-Turso, a fantasy action-adventure game, you’ll embark on a quest to vanquish an ancient evil and forge your own legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mysterious lands, gather powerful loot, and recruit allies to sta